    ["Bring Ran Bloodtooth's Skull and Dartol's Rod of Transformation to Raene Wolfrunner in Astranaar."] = "把蘭恩·血牙的顱骨和達圖爾的變形魔棒交給阿斯特蘭納的萊恩·狼行者。",
    ["Bring Razzle Sprysprocket in Kharanos 8 Restabilization Cogs and 8 Gyromechanic Gears."] = "收集8個多檔齒輪和8個自適應齒輪，把它們交給卡拉諾斯的拉茲·滑鏈。",
