    ["Bring the Bristleback Attack Plans to Chief Hawkwind in Camp Narache."] = "將刺背野豬人的進攻計劃交給納拉其營地的鷹風酋長。",
    ["Bring the Burning Blade Medallion to Zureetha Fargaze, outside The Den."] = "給大獸穴外的祖雷薩帶回火刃獎章。",
